00:44:01.605 --> 00:44:04.375
and he's partly
why I moved here.

00:44:04.375 --> 00:44:06.610 align:start size:84% position:16%
I think there's
reasons to back Trump,

00:44:06.610 --> 00:44:08.078
I think the machine

00:44:08.078 --> 00:44:11.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he's willing to do
