00:44:49.119 --> 00:44:50.821 align:start size:84% position:16%
and how much are they
beating Joe Biden

00:44:50.821 --> 00:44:53.223
or Kamala Harris or
Pete Buttigieg by?

00:44:53.223 --> 00:44:56.293
If they're beating those
guys by more than Trump,

00:44:56.293 --> 00:44:58.629 align:start size:84% position:16%
it's an important sign
that Donald Trump,

00:44:58.629 --> 00:45:00.464 align:start size:84% position:16%
